  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Peace and Democratisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to develop the dialogue between leading political actors on the benefits of and pathways towards a sustainable peace, reducing polarisation, and promoting inclusive negotiations. Emphasising women&apos;s participation and civil society engagement, DPI seeks to build trust and consensus across party lines.</narrative>
  </description>
